// 9(a) Create and Drop Databases and Collections

// 1. Create or switch to a database
use college

// 2. Create a collection
db.createCollection("students");

// 3. Display all databases
show dbs

// 4. Display collections in the current database
show collections

// 5. Drop a collection
db.students.drop();

// 6. Drop the current database
db.dropDatabase();